          "source_text": "国外现在是晚上吗",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-31-is-it-nighttime-in-other-countries-now_title_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "国外现在是晚上吗？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-31-is-it-nighttime-in-other-countries-now_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "是啊。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-31-is-it-nighttime-in-other-countries-now_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "总有一个地方是白天，一个是晚上。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-31-is-it-nighttime-in-other-countries-now_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "假设这个就是地球，太阳照过来，照到的这一面就是白天。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-31-is-it-nighttime-in-other-countries-now_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "它的背面就是晚上。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-31-is-it-nighttime-in-other-countries-now_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "而且地球还在转动。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-31-is-it-nighttime-in-other-countries-now_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "所以早上会慢慢变亮，晚上慢慢变黑。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-31-is-it-nighttime-in-other-countries-now_dialogue_007_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
